%% title: Payment incident lifecycle
%% truth_level: REFERENCE_ARCHITECTURE
%% last_verified: 2026-09-28
flowchart LR
  D[Detect] --> A[Acknowledge]
  A --> C[Classify]
  C --> CT[Contain]
  CT --> R[Recover]
  R --> RC[Reconcile]
  RC --> COM[Communicate]
  COM --> CL[Close]
  CL --> PM[Postmortem]
  PM --> REM[Remediate]
